<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">✓</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">41.3</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">65.5</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">22.0</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">46.5</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">78.1</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">97.0</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.8" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">72.4</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.9" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">86.9</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.10" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">54.1</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.11" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">84.0</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.12" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">33.7</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.16.13" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;padding:1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.16.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9E6F0;">66.6</span></td></tr>
</table>
</span></div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.3 </span>Ablation Study</h3>

<section id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Comparison of using different <math id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{M}}_{\mathcal{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{M}}_{\mathcal{E}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</h4>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The robustness of our method allows us to use varying sets of modality tokens <math id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{M}}_{\mathcal{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{M}}_{\mathcal{E}}</annotation></semantics></math> by differing the type of encoder <math id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{E}}</annotation></semantics></math> used. Our quantitative comparisons in Table <a href="#S4.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 4.2 Comparison Results ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Align Your Query: Representation Alignment for Multimodality Medical Object Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Quantitative Results. ‣ 4.2 Comparison Results ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Align Your Query: Representation Alignment for Multimodality Medical Object Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> contain results for varying <math id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{M}}_{\mathcal{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{M}}_{\mathcal{E}}</annotation></semantics></math> by selecting <math id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{E}}</annotation></semantics></math> as either CLIP, BiomedCLIP, or PubMedClip. Though our framework provides consistent performance increase regardless of <math id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{E}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we find CLIP and PubMedCLIP to consistently perform better than BiomedCLIP.
We attribute this to the better disentanglement of modality tokens in CLIP and PubMedCLIP as compared to BiomedCLIP (visualized in Figure <a href="#S4.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Comparison of using different ℳ_ℰ. ‣ 4.3 Ablation Study ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Align Your Query: Representation Alignment for Multimodality Medical Object Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>). Computation of silhouette scores <span id="footnote2" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup>
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
                
                
                
              A metric that evaluates the quality of a clustering solution assessing: 1) how well data points are grouped inside each of their respective clusters, and 2) how well those clusters are separated from each other.</span></span></span> supports this, showing that better disentanglement between modalities leads to improved performance.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.F4" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S4.F4.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:250.4pt;"><img src="2510.02789v1/umap_visualize2.png" id="S4.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:328/148;" width="328" height="148" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>UMAP embedding of modality tokens for varying <math id="S4.F4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{E}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:139.1pt;">
<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
<table id="S4.T3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S4.T3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></td>
<td id="S4.T3.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Baseline (ms)</span></td>
<td id="S4.T3.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T3.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ours (ms)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Def. DETR</td>
<td id="S4.T3.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">7.80</td>
<td id="S4.T3.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">8.71</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T3.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T3.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">DINO</td>
