<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Dataset Explanation</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In cases where datasets provided only segmentation masks without explicit bounding boxes, we generated detection annotations by extracting bounding boxes directly from the segmentation masks. Detailed descriptions of each dataset are provided below.</p>
