<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>The Use of Large Language Models (LLMs)</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The use of LLMs in this work was strictly limited to minor language polishing and did not influence research ideation, methodological design, or experimental analysis.
The authors take full responsibility for the accuracy and integrity of all scientific content presented in this paper.</p>
</div>
</section>
